        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 117,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "Therefore, will I not make solitary places to bud and to blossom, and to bring forth in abundance? saith the Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 35,
            "text": "Isa. 35:1 (1–2)."
          },
          {
            "start": 57,
            "end": 64,
            "text": "D&C 35:24; 39:13; 49:25. TG Earth, Renewal of."
