      {
        "text": "Therefore, come up hither unto the land of my people, even Zion.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Doctrine and Covenants 117:9",
        "book": "Doctrine and Covenants",
        "chapter": 117,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Let my servant William Marks be faithful over a few things, and he shall be a ruler over many. Let him preside in the midst of my people in the city of Far West, and let him be blessed with the blessings of my people.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 32,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "Matt. 25:23."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [
          {
            "raw": "Matt. 25:23.",
            "prettyString": "Matthew 25:23",
            "references": [
              {
                "type": "scripture",
